#: ../../reference/packages.rst:173
msgid ""
"The package depends on ``collections-defaultdict`` and ``os-path`` which "
"will be installed automatically from the :term:`micropython-lib`. The third "
"dependency installs the content as defined by the ``package.json`` file of "
"the ``main`` branch of the GitHub repo ``org/micropython-additions``."
msgstr ""
"แพ็กเกจขึ้นอยู่กับ ``collections-defaultdict`` และ ``os-path`` "
